---
import './AboutHero.css';
---

<div class="about-hero">
	<h2>You've reached `janis.me`</h2>
	<p>
		I'm Janis, a full-stack developer from Germany, passionate about turning next-gen web tech into something real and
		useful.
		<br>
		<br>
		I started programming profesionally <span class="strikethrough">7</span>
		<span class="strikethrough">8</span>
		9 years ago, first building data-science apps and insights dashboards. Then, I ended up building cloud-based CAE
		software and interactive 3D programs. Most recently, I started working on conversational AI at
		<a href="https://cognigy.com">cognigy</a>. Always looking for new ways to innovate and make things happen!
		<br>
		<br>
		I made my dream of living on the countryside come true, have two cats and play the base guitar (much to the dismay
		of my girlfriend).
	</p>
	<div>
		<h3>Some stuff I worked on (mini-CV):</h3>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://divecae.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dive</a>
				</b>
				- the leading cloud-native CAE platform. Users can simulate and analyze massive thermofluid systems on cloud
				GPUs,
				<b>directly in their browser</b>. Built with the power of WASM, WebGL/threejs, React and WebSockets.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://cognigy.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cognigy</a>
				</b>
				- the leader in Agent-based AI Customer support / CX. Allows building low-code conversation flows, configuration
				of Agents with support for all big LLM and TTS providers, third-party integrations, Natural language
				understanding and much more. <b>update:</b> has just been acquired by
				<a href="https://www.nice.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NiCE</a>
				for $955 million.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://handlery.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">handlery.dev</a>
				</b>
				- event handling library for typescript, using decorators and auto-generated types. Use it will any event
				emitter library you want. It works with all of them.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://surimi.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">surimi</a>
				</b>
				- type-safe CSS in TypeScript. Themes, media queries and mixins, compiled away to plain CSS. This site runs on
				it.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://licensephobia.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Licensephobia (WIP)</a>
				</b>
				- never be afraid of OpenSource licenses again. Check your dependency files (npm, pip, cargo...) and know
				exactly what rights you have.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://youtube.com/@roulzhq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ROULZ (youtube)</a>
				</b>
				- Tech content, making easy to follow deep-dives into interesting topics.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://sms-group.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SMS Group</a>
				</b>
				- enabled SMS's physical and mathematical models to run in the cloud, built new ML-based prediction models for
				steel casting, and a material-mix optimizer for electric arc furnaces.
			</li>
			<li>
				<b>
					<a href="https://caddly.roulz.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Caddly</a>
				</b>
				- A config file builder for the caddy webserver
			</li>
